  Why: 'On the Gap Brook, 1.3 m below the crossing (keyscene.stp_gap_bridge). Its surface is +4.960 (amendment 2 §4.2, question 1 (a)): the bowl spills at +4.9601 at (157.75, -42.75); the floor (+4.70) and the pads (+5.28) stand. Its water stands by flood, dropped by whole R16 steps if the flood escapes.'
